d · effective: 2025-05-01 to the day before 2026-02-01 · superseded by: HB-64\nThis version set the nightly lodging limit for all employees. Questions about the nightly lodging limit go to the travel office, who keeps the record of decisions. Managers confirm claims for the nightly lodging limit before payment in the next payroll run.\n<<end search-result SR-002>>\n"
